upstream pseudocode/error/Evidence contract, retained complete large decompilation and broad semantic equivalence are not established; the 141-input owned-function result is finite evidence only", "required_gates": ["contracts", "results", "evidence", "typed_outcomes", "limits_and_cancellation", "source_package_boundary", "provider_qualification", "native_semantics", "retention_and_pagination", "effects_and_recovery"], "routes": ["rea_static_profiles", "rea_static_start", "rea_static_status", "rea_static_read", "rea_static_cancel"]}, {"family": "direct", "name": "xrefs", "remaining_behavior": "Arbitrary-address/upstream query coverage, resolved native relationship semantics, exact normalized result/Evidence and additional providers remain unqualified", "required_gates": ["contracts", "results", "evidence", "typed_outcomes", "limits_and_cancellation", "source_package_boundary", "provider_qualification", "native_semantics", "retention_and_pagination", "effects_and_recovery"], "routes": ["rea_static_profiles", "rea_static_start", "rea_static_status", "rea_static_read", "rea_static_cancel"]}, {"family": "native", "name": "inspect_macho", "remaining_behavior": "Universal slices, selected-view mapping, native command/analysis details, source locations and exact upstream result", "required_gates": ["contracts", "results", "evidence", "typed_outcomes", "limits_and_cancellation", "source_package_boundary", "format_architecture_corpus", "retention_and_pagination", "effects_and_recovery"], "routes": ["rea_inspect_artifact"]}, {"family": "native", "name": "list_architectures", "remaining_behavior": "Universal slices, selected-view mapping, native command/analysis details, source locations and exact upstream result", "required_gates": ["contracts", "results", "evidence", "typed_outcomes", "limits_and_cancellation", "source_package_boundary", "format_architecture_corpus", "retention_and_pagination", "effects_and_recovery"], "routes": ["rea_inspect_artifact"]}, {"family": "artifact", "name": "inspect_artifact", "remaining_behavior": "Complete upstream container graph/Evidence/view and integrity-policy contracts, other formats and extraction; ASAR unpacked/link resolution, whole-archive content identity and publisher/fuse authentication remain unimplemented", "required_gates": ["contracts", "results", "evidence", "typed_outcomes", "limits_and_cancellation", "source_package_boundary", "format_architecture_corpus", "retention_and_pagination", "effects_and_recovery"], "routes": ["rea_inspect_artifact", "rea_inspect_archive", "rea_inspect_application", "rea_inspect_asar", "rea_read_asar_member"]}, {"family": "native", "name": "inspect_with_objdump", "remaining_behavior": "All caller-selected upstream operations/symbol selection, diagnostics, target/provenance and Evidence", "required_gates": ["contracts", "results", "evidence", "typed_outcomes", "limits_and_cancellation", "source_package_boundary", "provider_qualification", "format_architecture_corpus", "effects_and_recovery"], "routes": ["rea_static_profiles", "rea_static_start", "rea_static_status", "rea_static_read", "rea_static_cancel"]}, {"family": "android", "name": "inspect_android_package", "remaining_behavior": "Exact package/class/reference inventories, resource and signature observations required by the frozen package contract, retained Evidence and all input/error variants. The separate native signature-record report is not the complete upstream package response.", "required_gates": ["contracts", "results", "evidence", "typed_outcomes", "limits_and_cancellation", "source_package_boundary", "provider_qualification", "format_architecture_corpus", "retention_and_pagination", "effects_and_recovery"], "routes": ["rea_inspect_application", "rea_static_profiles", "rea_static_start", "rea_static_status", "rea_static_read", "rea_static_cancel"]}, {"family": "native", "name": "inspect_binary_layout", "remaining_behavior": "Full pwntools-profile symbol/relocation/mitigation observations, exact format/architecture semantics and Evidence", "required_gates": ["contracts", "results", "evidence", "typed_outcomes", "limits_and_cancellation", "source_package_boundary", "format_architecture_corpus", "retention_and_pagination", "effects_and_recovery"], "routes": ["rea_inspect_artifact", "rea_static_start", "rea_static_read"]}, {"family": "native", "name": "inspect_elf_notes", "remaining_behavior": "Exact PT_NOTE/SHT_NOTE coverage, owner/type/desc semantics and REA Evidence on an independent corpus", "required_gates": ["contracts", "results", "evidence", "typed_outcomes", "limits_and_cancellation", "source_package_boundary", "format_architecture_corpus", "retention_and_pagination", "effects_and_recovery"], "routes": ["rea_inspect_artifact", "rea_static_start", "rea_static_read"]}, {"family": "artifact", "name": "inspect_apk_signature", "remaining_behavior": "Complete frozen static APK signature observations, including v1/JAR signers and certificate facts, v3.1 declarations, proof-of-rotation/key-rotation observations, all required signer/certificate fields, and exact unknown/truncation/unsupported semantics; every upstream ArtifactInput variant/default, Evidence identity, analysis/view envelope, retained state, pagination and typed error. The finite mathematical verifier does not supply all of these original static observations and contracts.", "required_gates": ["contracts", "results", "evidence", "typed_outcomes", "limits_and_cancellation", "source_package_boundary", "format_architecture_corpus", "retention_and_pagination", "effects_and_recovery"], "routes": ["rea_inspect_apk_signature"]}, {"family": "application", "name": "trace_web_source_location", "remaining_behavior": "Exact upstream input/default/target selection and acquisition; authenticated script/application context; source URL resolution and embedded-content UTF-16 offset verification; complete Evidence/profile/typed outcomes; retained views and operation-specific recovery. The native report is not upstream REA Evidence.", "required_gates": ["contracts", "results", "evidence", "typed_outcomes", "limits_and_cancellation", "source_package_boundary", "js_graph_semantics", "format_architecture_corpus", "retention_and_pagination", "effects_and_recovery"], "routes": ["rea_inspect_source_map"]}, {"family": "browser", "name": "inspect_web_network_capture", "remaining_behavior": "Full HAR producer fields/number semantics, SAZ/mitmproxy/qlog/protobuf, credential exclusions and retained REA Evidence", "required_gates": ["contracts", "results", "evidence", "typed_outcomes", "limits_and_cancellation", "source_package_boundary", "format_architecture_corpus", "retention_and_pagination", "effects_and_recovery"], "routes": ["rea_inspect_web_capture"]}, {"family": "electron", "name": "analyze_javascript_application", "remaining_behavior": "Whole-artifact directory/ASAR inventory and selected/unselected source coverage in upstream application identity; unsupported/unpacked/link acquisition and publisher/integrity policies; automatic bundled/source-map/route associations and richer semantic graph relations; exact upstream node/unknown/deadline/partial-Evidence behavior; retained summary/view contracts and operation-specific REA Evidence identity.", "required_gates": ["contracts", "results", "evidence", "typed_outcomes", "limits_and_cancellation", "source_package_boundary", "js_graph_semantics", "retention_and_pagination", "format_architecture_corpus", "effects_and_recovery"], "routes": ["rea_inspect_javascript_graph"]}], "related": [{"family": "direct", "name": "inspect_native_load_image"}, {"family": "direct", "name": "list_segments"}, {"family": "direct", "name": "procedure_assembly"}, {"family": "direct", "name": "procedure_callees"}, {"family": "direct", "name": "procedure_callers"}, {"family": "direct", "name": "read_function_instructions"}, {"family": "enhanced", "name": "binary_overview"}, {"family": "enhanced", "name": "analyze_function"}, {"family": "android", "name": "searc